      "html": "<nav aria-label=\"导航预览\"><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#reading-overview\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v16\"/><path d=\"M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z\"/></svg><span>阅读概览</span></a></nav>",
